            "detailed_description": "<strong>NeXus: One Core</strong> is fast. It is challenging. It will test your skills like only a few games did before.  <br><br>Ready yourself for a extreme survival run paced by an immersive DnB Music. Set on a straight-line futurist track, your goal is to avoid obstacles while changing your ship color to pass deadly portals. <br><br>Play alone or share the control of your ship with a second player in a rad co-op mode. Either way, expect not to drop your controler anytime soon.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>One of the most extreme runner out there<br></li><li>Exclusive Fusion / Unfusion mechanics (co-op mode)<br></li><li>Randomly generated tracks<br></li><li>Ranking system with Leaderboards<br></li><li>A wide range of game modes<br></li><li>Customizable ships</li></ul>",
